'''Profile Decorations''' are equippable decorations that can applied to a users' [[Special:MyLanguage/Nameplates#User_icon|User Icon]], [[Special:MyLanguage/Social#User_profiles|User Profile]] and [[Special:MyLanguage/Nameplates|Nameplates]] separately.

== Types ==
There are three different types of Profile Decorations, each described below. 

=== Icon Frames ===
Icon Frames add an animated frame around an users' [[Special:MyLanguage/Nameplates#User_icon|User Icon]]

=== Profile Effects ===
Profile Effects add an animated effect on a users' [[Special:MyLanguage/Social#User_profiles|User Profile]]

=== Nameplate Themes ===
Nameplate Themes add an animated backdrop to an users' [[Special:MyLanguage/Nameplates|Nameplate]]

== Equipping ==
Profile Decorations can be equipped by editing a users' profile either in-game or on the VRChat website.

